    seoTitle: "How do you communicate design decisions to a non-designer stakeholder who may push back based on personal taste? | Graphic Designer Interview Question",
    seoDescription: "Interview-ready answer and practical example for: How do you communicate design decisions to a non-designer stakeholder who may push back based on personal taste?",
    isPublished: true,
